      "sourceText": "1. 安装\n\n   1. Ubuntu / Debian 安装\n\n      ```bash\n      wget -O warp-terminal.deb \"https://app.warp.dev/download?package=deb\"\n      sudo apt install ./warp-terminal.deb\n      ```\n\n      安装完成后，可以在应用菜单里打开 Warp，也可以在终端里输入：\n\n      ```bash\n      warp-terminal\n      ```\n\n   2. Fedora / RHEL 安装\n\n      如果你用的是 Fedora、RHEL、CentOS 这类发行版，可以安装 rpm 包：\n\n      ```bash\n      wget -O warp-terminal.rpm \"https://app.warp.dev/download?package=rpm\"\n      sudo dnf install ./warp-terminal.rpm\n      ```\n\n      启动方式同样是：\n\n      ```bash\n      warp-terminal\n      ```\n\n\n\n2. Warp 常用快捷键",
      "translatedText": "1. Install\n\n   1. Ubuntu / Debian installation\n\n      ```bash\n      wget -O warp-terminal.deb \"https://app.warp.dev/download?package=deb\"\n      sudo apt install ./warp-terminal.deb\n      ```\n\n      After installation, you can open Warp from the application menu, or enter the following in a terminal:\n\n      ```bash\n      warp-terminal\n      ```\n\n   2. Fedora / RHEL installation\n\n      If you are using a distribution such as Fedora, RHEL, or CentOS, you can install the RPM package:\n\n      ```bash\n      wget -O warp-terminal.rpm \"https://app.warp.dev/download?package=rpm\"\n      sudo dnf install ./warp-terminal.rpm\n      ```\n\n      The startup method is also:\n\n      ```bash\n      warp-terminal\n      ```\n\n\n\n2. Common Warp shortcuts",
